    one reminder-cadence history row
[DTO] PaymentIntentDto: method, amount, reference?, claimedAt, claimedBy?
    a customer's recorded payment claim
[DTO] QuoteDto: id, userId, customerId?, summary, jobName?, description?, descriptionByLang?, jobNameByLang?, summaryByLang?, lineItem(s), estimatedTotal?, status?, sentAt?, acceptedAt?, lostAt?, acceptedSignature?, acceptedName?, createdAt, updatedAt
    a persisted quote record
