    a partial quote patch
[DTO] ContractDto: id, userId, quoteId, customerId?, status?, effectiveDate?, startDate?, estimatedCompletionDate?, totalAmount?, signedAt?, term(s), mood?, createdAt, updatedAt
    a persisted contract record
[DTO] UpdateContractDto: quoteId?, customerId?, status?, effectiveDate?, startDate?, estimatedCompletionDate?, totalAmount?, signedAt?, term(s)
    a partial contract patch
[DTO] ContractListDto: contract(s)
    a list of contracts owned by the user
[DTO] InvoiceDto: id, userId, contractId?, jobName?, description?, dueDate, customerId?, amount?, discountCents?, discountReason?, issuedDate?, status?, paidAt?, scheduledFor?, installmentIndex?, installmentTotal?, remindersMuted?, reminderHistory(s), paymentIntent?, urgency?, createdAt, updatedAt
    a persisted invoice record
[DTO] UpdateInvoiceDto: contractId?, jobName?, description?, customerId?, amount?, discountCents?, discountReason?, issuedDate?, dueDate?, status?, paidAt?, scheduledFor?, installmentIndex?, installmentTotal?, remindersMuted?, reminderHistory(s), paymentIntent?
    a partial invoice patch
[DTO] InvoiceListDto: invoice(s)
    a list of invoices owned by the user
